    "excerpt": "Gulls circle the end of the pier. The lighthouse stands to the north. [[Climb the lighthouse->Lighthouse]] [[Wait for the boats|Boats]] The lamp room smells of oil. The brass lamp is cold. [[Light the lamp->Ending]] [[Go back down->Pier]] The fishing boats are late tonight. [[Pier]] The beam sweeps the water, and the boats turn for home.",
